Made it down to Dungeon level 23
Trapdoor deposits me someplace new...
"Welcome to David's Treasure Zoo!"

Word!
More --

Knockin' out the ettins and puddings too
Grabbin' so much treasure I don't know what to do
I pass up weapons, armor, and things
'cuz I'm much more interested in these rings!

Protection, polymorph, polymorph control
If I get these suckers on I'll be on a roll
But when I try to don these metallic bands
The cursed leather gloves won't come off my hands!

I pray to my god, I ask real nice
"Loki is pleased," but he treats me like ice
I'm gettin' so hooked on this game of 'hack
That I think about the altar ten levels back

I want these rings, I need 'em real bad
But the gloves just smile and say, "You've been had!"
I turn to my comrades on rec.games.hack
Where for advice and help, there's rarely a lack

So I throw this plea on out to youze,
Help me solve my glove-ring blues!

